<article class="env-lemma" id="0AKG">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0AKG">Lemma <span data-tag="0AKG">88.10.3</span>.</a> Let $A$ be a Noetherian ring. Let $I \subset A$ be an ideal. Let $B$ be an $I$-adically complete $A$-algebra with $A/I \to B/IB$ of finite type. The equivalent conditions of Lemma <a href="/tag/0AJU" data-tag="0AJU">88.8.2</a> are also equivalent to </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li class="custom-item" data-marker="(8)" id="0AKH"><p>
 there exists a finite type $A$-algebra $C$ such that $\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(C) \to \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A)$ is étale over $\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A) \setminus V(I)$ and such that $B \cong C^\wedge $. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Lemmas <a href="/tag/0AJU" data-tag="0AJU">88.8.2</a>, <a href="/tag/0AKA" data-tag="0AKA">88.10.2</a>, and <a href="/tag/0ALQ" data-tag="0ALQ">88.8.4</a>. Small detail omitted. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>